{"id":28159,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003eGraphic Team Application\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eMinecraft Username: BoldAndBrash\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eDiscord ID: badger#4517\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eIn 1 or 2 sentences, tell me who you are:\u0026nbsp;I'm a 14 year old with a lot of time on his hands. I spend most of it on Minecraft, but sometimes practice making things like logos.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eWhat program do you use to design in? Photoshop \u0026amp; paint.NET\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eIf you have past work, please link photos or videos. \u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/IJJiH\" title=\"Link: http://imgur.com/a/IJJiH\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/IJJiH\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/5511e\"\u003ehttp://imgur.com/a/5511e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eHave you ever marketed using your designing skills? Nope\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eIf yes above, please describe what you had to do and the challenges you faced.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat changes would you like to see made on the Graphic Design team? I don't think I've seen much of it at all, so I can't really say. I think having access to higher end software like PS would greatly help the team, though.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eHow active are you/how is your work ethic? I'm very active, spends at least 4 hours a day on the network. I like to get work done fast, too.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003eGraphic Team Application\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eMinecraft Username: BoldAndBrash\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eDiscord ID: badger#4517\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 